      "message": "fix(mcp): detect_holes on a stock source names the stock and the models to pick\n\nA Drill, Bore or Thread operation reads the stock when no model is\npicked as its source. Detect holes then found nothing and said \"the\nsource model\", which pointed at the wrong thing. The three refusals now\nsay \"the stock\" and add the fix: pick a model as the source\n(source: \"<model>\"), or import a model when the document has none. A\nmodel source keeps its old refusal.\n\nFixes #3544\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
